Usage: rmdir [OPTION]... DIRECTORY...

Remove the DIRECTORY(ies), if they are empty.

OPTIONS:
      --ignore-fail-on-non-empty  ignore each failure to remove a non-empty
                                  directory
  -p, --parents                   remove DIRECTORY and its ancestors
  -v, --verbose                   output a diagnostic for every directory
                                  processed
      --help                      display this help and exit
  -V, --version                   output version information and exit

EXIT STATUS:
  0  if OK,
  1  if minor problems,
  2  if serious trouble.

WinuxCmd is a Windows implementation of GNU CoreUtils for Linux-Windows developers and AI coding assistants.
